  "schema": "arcpuzzles-parametric-prototype-evidence-v1",
  "scope": "# Review \u2014 5d1263287a4f\n\nTask/source: `5d1263287a4f`, baseline generator `2.0.0` / `e88a731c\u2026`.\nCandidate: generator `2.1.0` / `5013bec0\u2026`; canonical rule hash remains `92f6a0f9f7b3`.\nDefect: weighted sampling could leave a three-demo lesson compatible with \u201creturn the rightmost third.\u201d\nRepair: a deterministic four-role layout cycle makes every cyclic three-demo window refute that shortcut.\nCompatibility: explicit overrides and the exact crop-left Racket authority are unchanged.\nProduction verification: 35/35 task tests plus self-check, Racket smoke, distribution, diversity, and 31,410 override draws passed.\nTeaching verification: the full four-residue schedule passed every query rotation with the named rival enabled.\nPrototype: proposed episode-fixed `output_transform` with three exact Racket settings and independent 4-demo/4-query support.\nPrototype evidence: 72 protected Racket applications passed; public exports are opaque, answer-free, sorted, and duplicate-rejecting.\nTickets: both bounded supplementary tickets completed; neither produced a new peer safety finding.",
